# One build context serves both images (Railway builds every service from the repo root),
# so this is an allowlist of what either Dockerfile copies. Each Dockerfile copies only its
# own paths, so the room service image stays lean.
*

# Workspace manifests (website build)
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json

# Shared packages: protocol schema (room service), workspace dependencies (website)
!packages/

# Room service
!services/signaling/pyproject.toml
!services/signaling/uv.lock
!services/signaling/app/

# Website, plus the extension's manifest so pnpm sees the whole workspace the lockfile lists
!apps/website/
!apps/extension/package.json
# The release notes page renders CHANGELOG.md at build time
!CHANGELOG.md

# Never: installs, builds and caches from a local checkout
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/dist
**/dist-store
**/.astro
**/*.zip
**/.env
